<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="armor">Body Armor for Shadow Priest DPS</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-shadow-priest-dps">Head for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>Easy choice, grab <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78703/hood-of-dying-light">
