<img alt="Hood of the Cleansing Flame" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_robe_raidpriest_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hood of the Cleansing Flame</span></a> from your prior Tier set until you can replace it with the new Tier set.<br/>
<br/>
