<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-shadow-priest-dps">Shoulders for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>As our goal is 4-Piece <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item-set=1067/regalia-of-dying-light">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Regalia of Dying Light</span></a>, we want to grab <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78750/mantle-of-dying-light">
<img alt="Mantle of Dying Light" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_robe_raidpriest_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mantle of Dying Light</span></a> here. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78366/mosswrought-shoulderguards">
<img alt="Mosswrought Shoulderguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_robe_raidwarlock_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mosswrought Shoulderguards</span></a> isn't a bad alternative item, so you could shift your off piece to it if you felt <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78461/gloves-of-liquid-smoke">
<img alt="Gloves of Liquid Smoke" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlet_pants_robe_raidpriest_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gloves of Liquid Smoke</span></a> is too contested.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62343/greater-inscription-of-charged-lodestone">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Charged Lodestone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_bloodstone_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Charged Lodestone</span></a>, requires <span class="rep-revered">Revered</span> reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1171/therazane">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Therazane</span></a>, or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=86403/felfire-inscription">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_mastersinscription.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Felfire Inscription</span></a> - Only Scribes may apply Inscription specific shoulder enchants on their own Shoulders.<div class="pad"></div>
