<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist-for-shadow-priest-dps">Waist for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>As it turns out, there are not many choices other than the highest item level belt in <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78391/cord-of-the-slain-champion">
<img alt="Cord of the Slain Champion" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_robe_raidmage_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cord of the Slain Champion</span></a>. It is worth looking at <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77187/vestals-irrepressible-girdle">
<img alt="Vestal's Irrepressible Girdle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_robe_raidpriest_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vestal's Irrepressible Girdle</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77179/tentacular-belt">
<img alt="Tentacular Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_robe_raidwarlock_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tentacular Belt</span></a> if you didn't manage to get <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71613/majordomos-chain-of-office">
<img alt="Majordomo's Chain of Office" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_robe_raidpriest_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Majordomo's Chain of Office</span></a> from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5723/firelands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Firelands</span></a>. You can also take a look at the Auction House for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78879/sash-of-relentless-truth">
