<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-shadow-priest-dps">Legs for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>This slot is fairly easy to choose from as our highest item level slot is also our <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item-set=1067/regalia-of-dying-light">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Regalia of Dying Light</span></a>. You can choose to pick up <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71980/lavaquake-legwraps">
<img alt="Lavaquake Legwraps" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_robe_raidmage_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lavaquake Legwraps</span></a> if you need more Haste or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71981/world-menders-pants">
