<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-shadow-priest-dps">Rings for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>Finally, the time where we have to choose between three 410 items, however, the choice is pretty clear cut as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78490/infinite-loop">
<img alt="Infinite Loop" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_88.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Infinite Loop</span></a>'s stats are relatively lackluster compared to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78491/signet-of-suturing">
<img alt="Signet of Suturing" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_104.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of Suturing</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78419/ring-of-the-riven">
<img alt="Ring of the Riven" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_102.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of the Riven</span></a>, even the normal version of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78491/signet-of-suturing">
<img alt="Signet of Suturing" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_104.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of Suturing</span></a> being better due to crit not being super useful for us. You can keep your previously held <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71217/infernal-signet-of-the-avengers">
<img alt="Infernal Signet of the Avengers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_98.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Infernal Signet of the Avengers</span></a> from the reputation grind until you can obtain any of these rings, and you have the option to pair it with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77108/seal-of-the-grand-architect">
<img alt="Seal of the Grand Architect" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_90.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Seal of the Grand Architect</span></a> if you need more Mastery or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77109/band-of-reconstruction">
<img alt="Band of Reconstruction" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_ring_generic_1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Band of Reconstruction</span></a> if you need more Haste from Valor Points.<br/>
