<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="staves-for-shadow-priest-dps">Staves for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>
<a class="q5 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71086/dragonwrath-tarecgosas-rest">
<img alt="Dragonwrath, Tarecgosa's Rest" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/stave_2h_tarecgosa_e_01stagefinal.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dragonwrath, Tarecgosa's Rest</span></a> is the best choice for any caster that can use it. There is no situation where this would not be your best weapon. If you get your hands on it, you will be using it for the rest of the expansion.<br/>
<br/>There are a couple of competing items that are decent when compared to the Main Hand and Off-hand combination. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78418/lightning-rod">
<img alt="Lightning Rod" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stave_2h_deathwingraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightning Rod</span></a> is a good weapon that has all the stats we're looking for and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78451/visage-of-the-destroyer">
<img alt="Visage of the Destroyer" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stave_2h_deathwingraid_d_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Visage of the Destroyer</span></a> is very well statted as well. There's also <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78477/titahk-the-steps-of-time">
<img alt="Ti'tahk, the Steps of Time" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stave_2h_deathwingraiddw_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ti'tahk, the Steps of Time</span></a> that has a support proc built within it if you're looking for that. With 4-Piece Tier 13, Haste procs can be detrimental to our new rotation.<br/>
